    <section class="practice" id="sect-00001">      <title>Activity</title>
      <exercise>
        <problem>
        <para><link class="os-embed" url="#exercise/Alg1_9_4_2_PLA_240"/></para>
        </problem>
        </exercise>
       
      <section id="sect-00002">
        <title>Video: Rewrite Squared Expressions</title>
        <para id="para-00031">Watch the following video to learn more about rewriting squared expressions.</para>
        <media alt="Placeholder for Alt Text">
          <iframe width="660" height="371.4" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/72e5797ce35541d183e0ff3955751a0ef621703e"/>
        </media>
      </section>
    </section>
    <note class="self-check" id="note-00001">
      <exercise id="exer-00009">
        <problem id="prob-00009">
        <para id="para-00032"><link class="os-embed" url="#exercise/Alg1_9_4_2_SC"/></para>
        </problem>
        </exercise>
       
    </note>
    <section id="sect-00003">
      <title>Factoring Perfect Square Trinomials</title>
      <para id="para-00033">To factor <term class="glossary-tooltip" id="term-00001">perfect square trinomial</term>s, follow the formulas:</para>
      <para id="para-00034"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00035"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00036">Let's look at an example of how to factor perfect square trinomials.</para>
      <para id="para-00037"><emphasis>Example</emphasis></para>
      <para id="para-00038">Factor <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
      <para id="para-00039"><emphasis>Step 1</emphasis> - Does the trinomial fit the perfect square trinomial pattern, <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math>? If so, write the first term as <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> and last constant as <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
      <list id="list-00002">
        <item>Is the first term a perfect square? Write it as a square, <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math>. Is <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> a perfect square? Yes — write it as <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math>. <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mspace width="0.278em"/></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></item>
      </list>
      <list id="list-00003">
        <item>Is the last term a perfect square? Write it as a square, <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math>. Is 4 a perfect square? Yes — write it as <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math>. <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></item>
      </list>
      <list id="list-00004">
        <item>Check the middle term. Is it <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>? Is <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> twice the product of <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> and 2? Does it match? Yes, so we have a perfect trinomial.</item>
      </list>
      <para id="para-00040"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.278em"/></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mrow><m:mo style="color:green">↘</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mrow><m:mo style="color:green">↙</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.278em"/></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00041"><emphasis>Step 2</emphasis> - Factor the binomial into: <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math>. </para><para id="para-00053"><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> </para><para id="para-00054"><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>·</m:mi><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>·</m:mi><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn style="color:red">3</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mi style="color:red">x</m:mi></m:mrow><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>·</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mn style="color:red">3</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mi style="color:red">x</m:mi></m:mrow><m:mi>·</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mn style="color:purple">2</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mn style="color:purple">2</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mspace width="0.278em"/></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mspace width="0.278em"/></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn style="color:red">3</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mi style="color:red">x</m:mi></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn style="color:green">2</m:mn></m:mrow><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn style="color:green">2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para>
      <para id="para-00042"><emphasis>Step 3</emphasis> - Check. </para><para id="para-00055"><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> </para><para id="para-00056"><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>·</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>·</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> </para><para id="para-00057"><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>✔</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></para>
      <note class="try" id="note-00002">
        <title>Try It: Factoring Perfect Square Trinomials</title>
          <exercise id="exer-00008">
          <problem id="prob-00008">
            <para id="para-00043">Factor <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>30</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
            <para id="para-00044">Write down your answer, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to compare your work.</para>
          </problem>
          <solution id="sol-00008">
            <para id="para-00045">Here is how to factor a perfect square trinomial:</para>
            <para id="para-00046"><emphasis>Step 1</emphasis> - Write the first term as <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> and the last constant as <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math>. </para><para id="para-00058"><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math>, <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para>
            <para id="para-00047">Make sure the middle term is <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>. <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>30</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></para>
            <para id="para-00048"><emphasis>Step 2</emphasis> - Factor the binomial into: <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math>. </para><para id="para-00059"><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para>
            <para id="para-00049"><emphasis>Step 3</emphasis> - Check.</para>
            <para id="para-00050"><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00051"><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00052"><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>30</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para></solution>
        </exercise>
      </note>
    </section>
  </content>
